      "classification": "acceptance_environment_defect",
      "finding": "After moving the authoritative release to sc_platform_control, sc_dev_demo had no active runtime release snapshot. The enterprise scenario catalog therefore returned ACTIVE_RELEASE_SNAPSHOT_NOT_FOUND and no rows.",
